WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:03.490
You know, I hate it when I'm right about horrible
things.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:04.910
I really do.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:10.880
But Americans are now the dangerous disease
carrying foreigners, just like I predicted

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.509
we would be some months ago.

00:00:12.509 --> 00:00:13.509
And I hate it.

00:00:13.509 --> 00:00:14.509
I'm not happy about this.

00:00:14.509 --> 00:00:16.080
I'm not gloating about this.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.149
It personally upsets me that this is the reality.

00:00:19.149 --> 00:00:24.860
Much of the world, at least for now, is safely
returning to normality.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:31.869
Friends in Belgium, France, a lot of different
places, masks required on public transit.

00:00:31.869 --> 00:00:36.970
Things are more spaced out at restaurants,
but increasingly unnormal existence is resuming

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.770
in countries that have successfully fought
the virus.

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:42.170
That is not the case in the United States.

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:45.600
We are not allowed to go to many parts of
the world.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:52.300
The travel bans, which we are known for, are
now against us because corona virus is raging

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.300
here.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:59.780
The American right wing is all about banning
others, but it is we who are now banned because

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:00.980
we are the danger.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:05.810
Visitors from 15 different countries can now
go to the European Union.

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:06.810
Not Americans.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:07.890
It's too dangerous.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.440
There's too much coronavirus here.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:10.440
We've failed.

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.920
We are on a list, so to speak.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:18.520
The American right has been demonizing others
as those who, like Tucker Carlson said on

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:24.520
his Fox News program some months ago, immigrants
make our country dirtier and poorer.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:25.520
That was Tucker Carlson.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.640
Well, the American right has said it's foreigners
who bring disease.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:34.960
The American right has said we need to stop
them from coming here.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:39.909
But now we're the ones that are too risky
for other countries to let us in.

00:01:39.909 --> 00:01:46.500
As Erica Lee writes in a Washington Post piece,
there is a very long history of tying foreigners

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.490
to disease here in the United States.

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:53.049
You go back to the seventeen hundreds Germans
and yellow fever.

00:01:53.049 --> 00:01:56.530
They were going to bring yellow fever Irish
in the eighteen hundreds.

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:58.850
They were going to bring cholera.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:01:59.850
So many examples.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:05.600
Chinese immigrants, smallpox and bubonic plague
and leprosy, Jews and tuberculosis.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:06.620
That's a classic.

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:09.829
Italians and polio in the early nineteen hundreds.

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:10.829
Mexico.

00:02:10.829 --> 00:02:14.700
Pins to plague typhus and smallpox.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:19.469
It's a very long list, and the links between
xenophobia and disease are widespread.

00:02:19.469 --> 00:02:26.090
They're long lasting and we've seen much of
the same more recently with Corona virus.

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:32.730
And so understand that Chinese flu, Wu Hahn
flu, cung flu is Donald Trump has repeatedly

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:34.200
called it all of that stuff.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.319
It's just more of the same.

00:02:35.319 --> 00:02:36.319
This is not new.

00:02:36.319 --> 00:02:38.930
We've seen this in the U.S. since the seventeen
hundreds.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:42.139
And of course, yeah, the virus originated
in China.

00:02:42.139 --> 00:02:43.139
And yet China lied.

00:02:43.139 --> 00:02:45.489
And yes, China should be held accountable.

00:02:45.489 --> 00:02:48.760
But every country dealt with a virus that
originated in China.

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:54.459
Most countries dealt with that virus that
originated in China far better than we did.

00:02:54.459 --> 00:02:58.019
So much better, in fact, that we are now banned
from many of those countries.

00:02:58.019 --> 00:02:59.290
It's an embarrassment.

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:02.829
The virus is exploding in huge parts of this
country.

00:03:02.829 --> 00:03:05.340
Again, a single day case record yesterday.

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:07.659
I will talk to you later on, by the way.

00:03:07.659 --> 00:03:12.900
Texas now two days in a row, setting its single
day case, death record exactly as we would

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:17.120
have predicted when cases started surging
in mid to late June.

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:19.840
This has nothing to do with immigration.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.409
It has to do with a late and terrible testing
program.

00:03:23.409 --> 00:03:28.959
Lack of a contact tracing program botched
and too early reopenings reluctance to wear

00:03:28.959 --> 00:03:31.089
masks in some states.

00:03:31.089 --> 00:03:33.650
And it's now bleeding into the responsible
states, too.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:37.099
I've been saying for several weeks now, we're
doing great.

00:03:37.099 --> 00:03:38.650
Here in Massachusetts.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:44.839
But it can't last forever when cases are so
high in so many of these other states and

00:03:44.839 --> 00:03:50.279
indeed cases and hospitalizations are starting
to trickle up here in Massachusetts.

00:03:50.279 --> 00:03:52.629
It's only a little bit, but it's starting
to happen.

00:03:52.629 --> 00:03:58.430
We're now the disease carrying foreigners
that have to be banned from other countries.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.469
And it's embarrassing and it's horrifying.

00:04:00.469 --> 00:04:01.689
And I hate it.

00:04:01.689 --> 00:04:05.329
But I understand why countries have to do
it is our weakness.

00:04:05.329 --> 00:04:07.829
Ego is our weakness.

00:04:07.829 --> 00:04:12.010
Anti science sentiment is at hyperpolarization.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:14.700
We won't ever be like those other countries.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.000
Many of us believe that won't ever come to
that.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:23.900
And now Corona virus has shown that we were
so extraordinarily unprepared and had failed

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:24.900
leadership.

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.010
So now the question is, what do we do?

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:28.440
Do we need another lockdown?

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:33.200
Do we need like a six week coordinated, full
lockdown?

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:35.110
If that's what we need, it's never going to
happen.

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:37.500
I mean, you know, I'm talking about you really.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.600
You don't leave your house without a mask.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:44.450
You really don't go anywhere other than for
four essential trips, grocery store or whatever

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.970
the case may be.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.160
And you'd have to do new stimulus payments,
I guess.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:50.230
Is that what we actually need now?

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:55.780
Because when you look at 10000 cases a day
in Florida, 10000 cases a day in Texas, you

00:04:55.780 --> 00:05:00.740
don't get that under control by saying, let's
just not go to bars.

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:02.530
Let let's not do indoor dining.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:03.530
You just don't.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.760
That's not how you get it under control.

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:07.150
Clearly, the summer heat isn't stopping it.

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:11.300
Clearly, it's just not going to disappear
in April, the way Donald Trump and so many

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:14.170
others said, we are nowhere near herd immunity.

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:18.810
But no matter what happens on that front,
you've got to be registered to vote.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:23.210
And we have to remove this administration
in November, because no matter what happens

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:28.050
between now and November 3rd, we need someone
else at the helm.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.060
That must happen.

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:33.160
And so we're going to talk about polling a
little later.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:38.100
Let's not take our eye off the ball when it
comes to acting responsibly day to day on

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.900
Corona virus.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.780
Let's do it and encourage everybody we know
to do it.

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:46.880
But when it comes to removing this failed
leader.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.880
Not really, really even a leader.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.240
We've got to not lose sight of that.

